OL,3,GNEWSAFraudster jailed over
OL,4,Amulti-million pound PPE scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fraudster has been jailed for helping
OL,7,Fto scam medical companies out of
OL,8,Fmillions of pounds through bogus
OL,9,Fpersonal protective equipment (PPE)
OL,10,Fdeals during the Covid-19 pandemic.
OL,12,FCraig Morris, 43, and Jogesh Bhandari,
OL,13,F60, bought luxury cars, holidays and a
OL,14,Fnew home after pretending they could
OL,15,Fsupply millions of boxes of nitrile
OL,16,Fgloves in the US and Germany.
OL,18,FThey were convicted of two counts of
OL,19,Fconspiracy to commit fraud by false
OL,20,Frepresentation as well as concealing
OL,21,Fand transferring criminal property at
OL,22,FLeicester Crown Court in July.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
